{{Quote|The second form of the [[Pole (1st Form)|Pole]], capable of controlling lightning.|Item}}
The '''Pole (2nd Form)''' is a {{Legendary}} [[sword]].

Pole (2nd Form) is an old sword, being used throughout most early builds. It has great stuns with its '''[X] Electric Prison''' having a wide hitbox and low endlag, alongside '''[Z] Hand of God''' having good burst damage and good range. It is paired best with stun-based fruits like [[Dark]], [[Ice]] and even [[Sand]]. 

Despite its strong [[Stun|stuns]] and easy obtainment, swords like [[Dragon Trident]] and [[Cursed Dual Katana]] surpass it in terms of mobility, or [[Area of Effect|AoE]].

==Obtainment==
The Pole (2nd Form) can be obtained by getting struck by lightning in [[Rough Sea]] while holding [[Pole (1st Form)]].

The following message will appear when the lightning strikes the user: "''' Your <[[Pole (1st Form)]]> has transformed upon reacting with the lightning... You obtained <Pole (2nd Form)>'''''."''

