==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* High stun and damage.
* Unlike [[Lightning]], it can hit [[Rubber]] users.
* Good for any build, as it has a good [[Combos|combo]] potential.
* Very easy to obtain.

|'''[Z] Hand of God''' 
* Good stun move.
* Good range with 3 chances to hit.

|'''[X] Electric Prison'''
* Good combo follow-up.
* Good hitbox.
* Okay range.
