|'''General'''
* All moves cannot damage [[Sea Beast|Sea Beasts]].
* Cannot hit [[Blade]] users.
* The M1 attacks are slow.
* High mastery requirement (350 Mastery).
* No mobility moves.

|'''[Z] Hand of God'''
* Needs to hit the ground or a solid object to [[Instinct/Break|break Instinct]].
